  <h2 id="s7">7. Shipping, title and risk of loss</h2>
  <p>Unless otherwise agreed in writing, all sales are <b>F.O.B. our facility, Florida</b>. Title and risk of loss pass to you when we deliver the goods to the carrier. Shipping dates are estimates only; we are not liable for carrier delays. You must inspect deliveries on receipt and report shortages, damage or incorrect items to us within <b>5 business days</b>; claims not reported within that period are waived to the extent permitted by law. Concealed-damage claims must be filed with the carrier and reported to us within the same period, with photographs of the packaging and goods. You are responsible for all import duties, taxes and brokerage fees on international shipments and for compliance with export laws.</p>
  <p><b>Shipping charges.</b> Shipping is quoted at checkout from live UPS and FedEx rates for the destination and the actual parcels in the order (we do not ship by USPS). We pack to carrier rules: every complete driveshaft, every length of tubing and any single part over 35 lb ships in its own box; other components are combined in boxes of up to 50 lb. Each box carries its own label and is rated separately, so an order that needs several boxes is charged the sum of those rates. Where a live rate cannot be obtained for your address, contact us and we will quote shipping before the order ships. Full details are in our <a href="/shipping-policy">Shipping Policy</a>.</p>
  <p><b>Freight (LTL) shipments.</b> Orders of five or more tubes or complete driveshafts, orders of 100 lb or more, and any single piece longer than 108 inches are packed on a pallet and shipped by LTL truck freight. Freight is quoted at checkout from live carrier rates. Freight rates assume delivery to a business with a loading dock unless you tell us at checkout that the delivery is to a residence or needs a liftgate, so please answer that question accurately. You or your representative must be available to receive a freight delivery and to note any visible damage on the delivery receipt before signing.</p>
  <p><b>Free shipping.</b> We offer free U.S. ground shipping on orders over <b>${{ number_format(config('uds.free_shipping_min')) }}</b>. The offer applies to shipments within the contiguous (lower 48) United States only. <b>Custom cut tubing and complete driveshafts</b> (premade, short couple, unwelded assemblies, vehicle-specific driveshafts and shafts built through the online builder) do not count toward the ${{ number_format(config('uds.free_shipping_min')) }} threshold and are never shipped free: when the rest of the order qualifies, the remaining parts ship free and you pay only the carrier rate for the tube and driveshaft boxes, shown as its own option at checkout. Orders that ship by freight on a pallet never ship free, and free-shipping coupons do not apply to freight. Free shipping is ground service; expedited services, Alaska, Hawaii, U.S. territories, APO/FPO and international destinations are always charged at the quoted rate. We may change or withdraw the offer at any time; the rule in force when your order is placed applies.</p>
